      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane Straight Pipe (Manifold)</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_PrimaryStraight.dds</Icon>
      <Description>CO2 supply/return pipe within one independent reactor manifold circuit on one physical grid. Align H to H and C to C. Cap unused pipe mouths; a breach closes this circuit at the reactor. Ordinary conveyors do not replace thermal pipes.</Description>
