      <Id>
        <TypeId>UpgradeModule</TypeId>
        <SubtypeId>ArcanePower_Thermal_SpaceRadiatorUpgraded</SubtypeId>
      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane Space radiator upgraded</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_SpaceRadiatorUpgraded.dds</Icon>
      <Description>100 GW ideal heat rejection per unit/panel. Bottom socket; automatic edge-on sun tracking. Zero solar exposure gives 100% cooling; full sun on either face gives 50%. Angle, shade and weather follow solar-panel exposure. Stack up to two aligned panels on the same grid. Mixed tiers add their own cooling. Keep both faces exposed to space. Requires 10 Aether Residuum recovered from T1 fuel.</Description>
